  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Units for direct distance from the patient’s primary residence to the facility where the radiation therapy course is delivered. Provides a PHI neutral measure of accessibility. </rdfs:comment>
  <ValueType rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Attribute</ValueType>
