  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Number of sessions used to deliver the dose in each course. Will be single value for Component values and list of values for Cumulative values. For list use same order as Reirradiation Evaluation Course Names </rdfs:comment>
  <ValueType rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Attribute</ValueType>
  <StringCode rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ReirradiationEvaluation_ComponentValueNumberOfSessions</StringCode>
