  <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Treatment Plan Details - BeamCalculationParameters</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Details about the algorithm or calculation parameters used to for the treatment plan. These may vary widely among manufacturer systems. This section allows capture of specific items that may be of interest for a study. </rdfs:comment>
