  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Categorization of number of copies of a specific DNA segment (gene, region, or locus) present in an individual’s genome, relative to a reference baseline. CNV &lt;, =, &gt; relative to 1.0 indicate deletion, normal, or duplication respectively</rdfs:comment>
  <ValueType rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Attribute</ValueType>
