  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Date when the site initiated operations. Used in an analogous fashion to date of birth for patients to calculate age of patient at event time points to protect PHI while tracking longitudinal trends.</rdfs:comment>
